  "guarantee": "For one caller-declared subject operation, one declared execution context, and one complete exact nonempty forbidden-operation population, the subject does not use any forbidden member in that context; one verification reads the exact subject, context, population, and every forbidden member, verifies that prohibition, and carries same-subject, same-context positive use of the same complete population as its falsifier.",
